## Development Workflow

### Git Flow
- **Main**: Production-ready code
- **Develop**: Integration branch
- **Feature**: `feature/{ticket}-{description}`
- **Hotfix**: `hotfix/{ticket}-{description}`

### Pull Request Requirements
- [ ] All Rust and frontend tests pass
- [ ] `cargo clippy -- -D warnings`, `cargo fmt --check`, `tsc --noEmit` and lint pass
- [ ] Capability and `tauri.conf.json` changes reviewed
- [ ] Coverage >= 80%
- [ ] `cargo deny check` / `cargo audit` and `npm audit` pass
- [ ] Code reviewed

## Commands Reference

Commands run in Docker where possible; GUI launches run on the host OS.

### Development
```bash
npm run tauri dev                 # Run the app with the frontend dev server
npm run tauri build               # Production build and bundles
npm run tauri android dev         # Android (after `tauri android init`)
npm run tauri ios dev             # iOS (after `tauri ios init`)
```

### Testing
```bash
cargo test --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml     # Rust unit and mock-runtime tests
npx vitest run                                      # Frontend tests (mockIPC)
npx wdio run wdio.conf.ts                           # E2E (WebdriverIO + @wdio/tauri-service)
```

### Quality
```bash
cargo fmt --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml --all -- --check
cargo clippy --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml --all-targets -- -D warnings
npx tsc --noEmit
cargo deny --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml check
```

### Plugins and Signing
```bash
npm run tauri add <plugin>                # Add an official plugin
npm run tauri signer generate -- -w ~/.tauri/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.key   # Updater signing key (keep private)
```
